// Bounded warrant-carrying deployment typestate D10.
//
// Public records are non-authoritative observations or refusals. Positive
// typestate tokens and every authority-bearing type are module-private.
// Imported callers may pipe private tokens by inference, but cannot construct
// their literals. Frozen fixture producers remain callable and authenticate no
// external origin. Spending and revocation preserve exact immutable local
// transition traces, not affine consumption, a shared ledger, or a live
// institutional reference monitor.

use epistemic::proof_carrying_statistical_coverage_empirical_binding::*

